# Frontend — React + Redux

## Mandatory

- SPA only (**React** — Vue also allowed by brief; this project locks React). State via **Redux** (Flux).
- Mobile-first responsive across breakpoints; reference min viewport iPhone SE 2020 (~375×667 CSS px). No overflow; interactions stay within viewport.
- **Images (5 pts):** optimized (proper size/format), load fast, never cause layout overflow or CLS; use explicit dimensions or aspect-ratio.
- **Multi-browser (bonus):** verify Chromium + Firefox + Safari (or WebKit); no browser-only APIs without fallback.
- Persist checkout slice safely (redux-persist / selective `localStorage`).

## UI flow mapping

| Route/view | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| Product | Stock + price + description + Pay CTA |
| Modal form | Card + delivery validation; optional brand logos |
| Backdrop summary | Material Backdrop; totals (product + base fee + delivery) + confirm |
| Status | Success/failure messaging |
| Return | Product with updated stock |

## Patterns

- Presentational components + container/hooks; async via thunks or RTK Query.
- **CSS (bonus 10):** intentional flexbox/grid, consistent spacing/typography; polished mobile UI — not default unstyled forms.
- Button label for start checkout: **"Pay with credit card"**.
- Unit-test components, reducers, validators with Jest (>80%).
